go-for-it-qt (2.0.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bug-fix release 2.0.2.
  * Fix GitLab synchronization failing with HTTP 400 (invalid order_by value)
    and show GitLab's error message in sync errors.
  * Keep the mini player open when the main window is hidden to the tray,
    make it draggable, and add previous/next task buttons.
  * Status push: Jira reopen targets "To Do" and falls back to Bearer auth,
    YouTrack uses the mapped states with braced multi-word names, Nextcloud
    keeps COMPLETED/PERCENT-COMPLETE consistent.
  * Reject empty or non-numeric TUI duration input instead of setting the
    maximum.
  * Add German, Spanish, French and Italian translations to the desktop entry.

 -- Yurii Myronchuk <bladeroot@gmail.com>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100

go-for-it-qt (2.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Maintenance Release 2.0.1: resolves 87 stability and synchronization defects.
  * Implement remote completion/reopening status sync for Jira, YouTrack, and Nextcloud.
  * Extend remote list recognition to Redmine, Todoist, and Nextcloud.
  * Fix TUI duration integer overflow on large input values.
  * Normalize minimum integer durations in schedule bounds.
  * Fix GitHub search queries with non-state qualifiers.
  * Improve ANSI sequence handling and terminal width truncation in TUI.

 -- Yurii Myronchuk <bladeroot@gmail.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:30:00 +0100

go-for-it-qt (2.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Major Release 2.0.0: Full C++20 / Qt 6 rewrite with GUI and TUI clients.
  * Native issue tracker and task integrations: GitHub, GitLab, Jira,
    YouTrack, Redmine, Todoist, and Nextcloud Tasks (CalDAV/VTODO).
  * Multi-account and multi-list aggregate views with per-integration
    remote status and priority mapping.
  * Full Vim-style Terminal UI (go-for-it-tui) with ANSI color-coded
    priorities and keyboard workflow.
  * Productivity Analytics Dashboard with Pomodoro charts, tag
    distribution, activity heatmap, and PDF/CSV billing reports.
  * Always-on-top Mini-Player (PiP) window for uninterrupted focus.
  * Due dates (due:YYYY-MM-DD) and smart filters (Today, Overdue, Week).
  * Procedural Ambient Focus Sound Generator (White Noise, Rain, Clock).
  * Quick task jump to browser (xdg-open) via 'w'/'gx' in TUI and
    link button in GUI.

 -- Yurii Myronchuk <bladeroot@gmail.com>  Sat, 07 Nov 2026 04:30:00 +0100

